{
  "id": "1SA.20",
  "number": "20",
  "bookId": "1SA",
  "reference": "1 Samueli 20",
  "verseCount": 42,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "20",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1SA 20"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "20",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha Daudi wachimbira kula Nayothi hiko Rama, achiphiya kpwa Jonathani, achendamuuza, “Nkahenda utu wani? Uyi wangu ni uphi? Dambi yangu nchiyomkosera sowe ni iphi, hadi analonda kunituluza roho?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye wamjibu, “Kundafwa bii! Baba kahenda dzambo rorosi, kulu wala dide bila ya kunifwinya likombe. Siona chausa cha iye kunifwitsa dzambo hiri. Hivyo ugombavyo si kpweli.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela Daudi wajibu achiamba, “Sowe anamanya vinono sana kukala uwe wanitsunuka, naye mwakpwe moyoni anaamba, ‘Jonathani asirimanye dzambo hiri, sedze akasononeka,’ ela ni kpweli naapa kpwa dzina ra Mwenyezi Mlungu na kpwa rohoyo kukala naweza kuolagbwa wakati wowosi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipho Jonathani achimuambira Daudi, “Niambira vira ulondavyo nami ndakuhendera.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.28.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isabu 28:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Daudi achimuambira Jonathani, “Muhondo ni sikukuu ya kulumbwa kpwa mwezi nami lazima nsagale chakuryani phamwenga na mfalume. Ela niricha nkadzifwitse deteni hadi siku ya hahu dziloni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sowe achimanya sipho na achikuuza muambe, ‘Daudi kapho, wanivoya sana nimuphe ruhusa aphiye kpwao Bethilehemu mara mwenga mana kuna sadaka ya chila mwaka kpwa ajili ya atu osi a nyumba yao.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Napho andaamba, ‘Ni sawa!’ Ndipho mino mtumishio ndakala ni salama. Ela achitsukirwa, umanye kukala akakusudiya kuhenda mai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kpwa hivyo nionera mbazi mtumishio, mana hwaikirana chilagane mbere za Mwenyezi Mlungu hukale asena a kurya na kuusa. Ela ichikala undaona uyi moyoni mwangu, phahi niolaga uwe usiniphirike nkaolagbwe ni sowe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Jonathani achiamba, “Hata! Kalapho namanya kukala baba wakusudiya kukuhenda mai, dze, mino nisingekuambira?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipho Daudi achimuuza Jonathani, “Ni ani ndiyeniambira napho sowe andakujibu chisiru?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jonathani achimuambira Daudi, “Huphiye vyehu hiko kondze mindani.” Osi airi achiphiya mindani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariphofika hiko Jonathani wamuambira Daudi, “Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wa Iziraeli naakale shaidi, ndiphokala nkamuuza baba, muhondo wakati kama huno, au siku ya hahu napho kuna neno ra kukufwaha, ndakpwedza nikumanyise neno hiro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela napho baba akakusudiya kukuhendera mai na nisikuambire na kukuterya kuchimbira na ukale salama, phahi Mwenyezi Mlungu naanione. Nakuvoyera Mwenyezi Mlungu akale phamwenga nawe, dza arivyokala phamwenga na baba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Napho ndakala nchere moyo, undanionyesa mendzwa ya Mwenyezi Mlungu isiyosika ili nisifwe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.9.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Samueli 9:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ela hata nchifwa aonere mbazi atu a chivyazi changu. Wakati Mwenyezi Mlungu ndiphokala akaangamiza avihao tsetsetse hipha duniani.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi Jonathani waika chilagane na nyumba ya Daudi",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20:16",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Vitabu vyanjina vinaamba,",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "“Usiriche dzina ra Jonathani riuswe kula nyumba ya Daudi.”",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " na kuamba, “Mwenyezi Mlungu naariphize maadui ga Daudi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Jonathani wamuhenda Daudi aape kano ya phiri, kpwa sababu ya mendzwa ariyokala nayo, mana Jonathani kala anammendza Daudi dza vyokala adzimendzavyo mwenye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha Jonathani achimuambira, “Muhondo ni sikukuu ya kulumbwa kpwa mwezi nawe undamanyikana kukala kupho, kpwa mana phatupho phandakala taphana mutu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawe godza kuko hadi siku ya hahu ambapho chila mutu andamanya kupho, chisha phiya upesi hiko urikodzifwitsa mambo gaga gariphoandza siku hira. Uchifika kuko kakale phephi na hira ndulu ya mawe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20:19",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Vitabu vyanjina vinaamba,",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "ukakale phephi na dziwe ra Azeli.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndajeza mivi mihahu kanda-kandaye, avi nalenga shabaha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha ndamuhuma barobaro nimuambe, ‘Phiya ukaiendze hira mivi.’ Naapa kpwa dzina ra Mwenyezi Mlungu undamanya napho kusalama kpwa vira ndivyomuambira hiye mwanache. Nchimuamba, ‘Mivi i hiku uphandeo itsole,’ phahi wedze, mana kuna amani na takuna hatari yoyosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela nchimuambira, ‘Mivi i hiko mberezo,’ phahi takuna usalama phiya vyako, mana Mwenyezi Mlungu akakuamuru uuke. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na kuhusu chira chilagane chehu huchicholagana, Mwenyezi Mlungu andahakikisha hukagatimiza hadi kare na kare.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi Daudi wadzifwitsa hiko mindani na mwezi uripholumbwa, mfalume wakpwedza shareeni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "achisagala phephi na chambaza dza siku zosi. Jonathani kala a mbereze, Abineri naye achisagala phephi na Sauli. Nafwasi ya Daudi yakala taina mutu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela Sauli kayagomba neno siku iyo mana waona kukala, Daudi akapatwa ni neno ambaro rikamuhenda asikale swafi kukala shareeni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siku ya phiriye iriphokala nafwasi ya Daudi taina mutu piya, Sauli wauza mwanawe Jonathani, “Mbona mwana wa Jese kedzere chakuryani dzana wala rero?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Jonathani wajibu achiamba, “Daudi wanivoya sana nimuphe ruhusa aphiye Bethilehemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waniamba, ‘Navoya uniphe ruhusa niphiye mana hiko kpwehu kaya kundakala na sadaka na mwenehu akanilagizira nisikose kuphiya. Phahi ichikala ni vinono, nakuvoya uniphe ruhusa nkalole enehu.’ Ndiyo sababu kedzere chakuryani pha mfalume.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sauli wamdemurira Jonathani na usiru achimuamba, “Uwe u mwana wa mchetu mkaidi na muasi. Mino namanya wamgbwira usena ye mwana wa Jese. Ela andakuaibisha uwe mwenye na mayoo andajuta wakuvyarirani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana ichikala mwana wa Jese andakala moyo, uwe kundaongokerwa wala ufalumeo taundaimarika. Phahi vi sambi huma akalungbwe, mana iye kpwa kpweli ni afwe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jonathani achimjibu ise achimuamba, “Daudi andaolagbwa kpwa sababu yani? Wahendadze?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sauli achimtsuphira fumo kulonda kumuolaga Jonathani ndipho achimanya kpwa kpweli ise akakusudiya kumuolaga Daudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi Jonathani wauka hipho chakuryani na tsukizi nyinji wala kayarya siku iyo ya phiri ya sikukuu ya kulumbwa kpwa mwezi, mana wamsononekera Daudi sana na kpwa sababu ya kutiywa waibu ni ise.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ligundzure Jonathani waphiya mundani wakati uratu ariolagana na Daudi phamwenga na hiye mwanache. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Achimuambira ye mwanache, “Zola mairo, ukaiendze mivi niitsuphayo.” Yuya mwanache ariphokala anazola, Jonathani wajeza muvwi uchitsupa na dzulu za ye mwanache. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na hiye mwanachewe ariphofika phenye nyo muvwi, Jonathani achimpigira kululu achimuamba, “Muvwi u ko mberezo!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jonathani wamkotera kululu iye mwanachewe achimuamba, “Upesi! Zola mairo usichelewe!” Mwanache wa Jonathani watsolatsola yo mivi, achiuya kpwa bwanawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela hiye mwanache kamanyire chiendereracho. Jonathani na Daudi ndio ariomanya dzambo hiro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Jonathani achimupha hiye mwanachewe hizo silahaze, achimuambira, “Ziphirike mudzini.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mara tu ariphouka yuya mwanache, Daudi watuluka kula hipho nyuma ya chitsulu, achidzibwaga chimabumabu, achisujudu kano tahu; nao achidonerana na chila mutu achiririra myawe, ela chiriro cha Daudi chazidi cha Jonathani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alafu Jonathani achimuambira Daudi, “Phiya vyako kpwa amani, navikale viratu hurivyoapirana kpwa dzina ra Mwenyezi Mlungu huriphoamba, ‘Mwenyezi Mlungu andakala kahi ya mimi na uwe, na kahi ya chivyazi changu na chivyazicho, ili huike chilagane chehu hata kare na kare.’ ” Daudi wauka, achiphiya vyakpwe, naye Jonathani achiuya mudzini.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.42"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
